            ^"Category" STRING "Outfittings" FIXED
            ^"Modifiers" STRING "–2 General Quality, –1 Safety, –1 Aesthetics."
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab is partially damaged, for example as the result of a lab accident. It takes one season to repair the damage and lose this Flaw."
    }
    #trVFsFZmKDJBlof29XHPR2HB ^"Disorganized (Lab Flaw)" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Laboratory Flaw"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Free" FIXED
            ^"Category" STRING "Outfittings" FIXED
            ^"Modifiers" STRING "–1 Safety, –1 Aesthetics; +1 Mu or Experimentation."
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab is organized in a rather haphazard or carefree fashion. Some magi prefer it this way."
    }
    #t5fosVw2MR1l1GdKRQoXqwhY ^"Hidden Defect (Lab Flaw)" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Laboratory Flaw"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Free" FIXED
            ^"Category" STRING "Outfittings" FIXED
            ^"Modifiers" STRING "–3 Safety."
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "A subtle and potentially dangerous error exists in the lab's configuration. This is usually the fault of the owner, but it may also be caused by a malicious and clever third party. There is a chance to gain (or lose) this Flaw whenever a season of work is undertaken to improve the Refinement (see Refinement, earlier). Whenever this defect is the cause of a lab botch, make a Perception + Magic Theory roll against an Ease Factor of 12. If this succeeds, the defect is spotted and may be corrected with a few hours of work."
        REFERENCES {
            "Magic Theory" -> #t7KPhjriPvQO5FqBFYxCbWYN ^"Magic Theory"
            "Ease Factor" -> #tGQufzy8y8Qc3foo2n9p7nMU ^"Ease Factor"
        }
    }
    #t8ZLKcJAwYJ7wCBc4s09dikz ^"Missing Ingredients (Lab Flaw)" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Laboratory Flaw"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Free" FIXED
            ^"Category" STRING "Outfittings" FIXED
            ^"Modifiers" STRING "–1 Upkeep."
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Due to a lack of certain ingredients, lab work involving either one specific Technique or two specific Forms is severely hampered — relevant Lab Totals are halved. For example, the lab might contain no silver, in which case Terram and Vim Lab Totals are halved. It does not take a season to remove this Flaw, if sufficient funds are available to increase the Upkeep."
    }
    #tHsNvcekc3PvBAQ4OK4FAs28 ^"Missing Sanctum Marker (Lab Flaw)" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Laboratory Flaw"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Free" FIXED
            ^"Category" STRING "Outfittings" FIXED
            ^"Modifiers" STRING "–1 Aesthetics."
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The sanctum marker is not prominently displayed, and is thus easy to miss, or it is missing altogether. Hermetic magi might (unwittingly or knowingly) intrude. It does not take a season to remove this Flaw."
    }
    #tEoe1NGWgCpcebj2NmAXBiRp ^"Wrecked (Lab Flaw)" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Laboratory Flaw"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Free" FIXED
            ^"Category" STRING "Outfittings" FIXED
            ^"Modifiers" STRING "–5 General Quality, –2 Safety, –2 Aesthetics."
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab is very heavily damaged, for example as the result of a major lab accident. It takes two seasons to repair the damage completely and lose this Flaw. (After one season, it may be replaced by the Damaged Flaw.)"
    }
    #tSqkBtLY0gkrdUf0iGMswreg ^"Missing Equipment (Lab Flaw)" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Laboratory Flaw"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Minor" FIXED
            ^"Category" STRING "Outfittings" FIXED
            ^"Modifiers" STRING "–1 Upkeep."
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Due to a lack of certain equipment, lab work in one or two types of activity is totally impossible. For example, if there is no desk, parchment, or inks, you cannot work with texts. If you pick Items, Spells, or Texts, only this one activity cannot be undertaken. Otherwise, you must pick two of the activity categories (see the Specialization section earlier, page 290). This Flaw cannot be taken more than twice."
    }
    #tA3qkY0gOLtnaTfSYncT8y8b ^"Undecorated (Lab Flaw)" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Laboratory Flaw"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Minor" FIXED
