            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "A powerful supernatural creature (Might 20 or higher), which is not the familiar of the owner, resides in the lab and acts as its protector, being well-disposed to the owner. Woe betide any who should intrude."
    }
