            ^"Fantasy Level" STRING "low" FIXED
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Within the covenant’s vicinity lies a castle belonging to a major noble or the Crown. Like most castles, it is ungarrisoned in times of peace. A constable, perhaps a minor knight, and his household keep it ready for rapid militarization, should trouble brew."
    }
