            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab benefits from distinguished construction techniques, for example, high quality building materials were used, or it was made by a master architect or a magus (such as with the spell Conjuring the Mystic Tower). If constructing the building, its cost is doubled. +1 Safety, +1 Aesthetics."
