            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Part of the structure has subsided or is otherwise warped. For example, one wall has partially collapsed into rubble, and has to be propped up. –1 Safety, –1 Aesthetics; +1 Mu or Pe."
    }
    #tPv0JHY7ThgyWGI0mJJN4b9q ^"Disguised" DEF {
