        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab is configured for an especially small magus (Size –1 or less), who may use it normally. However, a normal-sized magus (or a normal-sized assistant) would have (or cause) considerable difficulty. For characters with Size 0 or greater: –1 General Quality, –2 Safety, –1 Health, –1 Aesthetics)."
    }
