            ^"Abilities" STRING "[Native Language] 5, Animal Handling 1 (horses), Athletics 2 (running), Awareness 2 (alertness), Brawl 4 (dagger), Bows 3 (long bow), Carouse 2 (power drinking), Covenant Lore 2 (rules), Folk Ken 1 (grogs), Great Weapon 3 (great sword), Hunt 0 (2) (on horse), Leadership 4 (training), Ride 3 (battle), Single Weapon 7 (long sword), Stealth 2 (hide), Survival 2 (woods), Swim 1 (stay afloat), Teaching 4 (soldiers), Thrown Weapon 3 (knife)"
