            ^"Size" STRING "Minor" FIXED
            ^"Category" STRING "Supernatural" FIXED
            ^"Source" STRING "Hedge Magic [Revised Edition]"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The folk witch can heal animals, and she has a Supernatural Ability Animal Healing with a Score of 1. This works exactly the same as the Healing Ability except that it works on animals instead of people (expending Animal vis instead of Corpus). A folk witch character can also make potions using this Ability. This is not normally a Favored Ability of folk witches, although it is for some variant covens. The character may also have the Healing Ability."
    }
    #tvtHsy2mDGE6tZVjw3THtqmk ^"Unstable Magic" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Flaw"
