            ^"Size" STRING "Minor" FIXED
            ^"Category" STRING "Supernatural" FIXED
            ^"Source" STRING "Hedge Magic [Revised Edition]"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Things that the folk witch creates in the laboratory (potions, fetishes, etc.) decay and cease to work after one year and one day. This Flaw is suitable for a Gifted character whose Opening of The Gift was flawed, although it may also be taken by unGifted characters."
        REFERENCES {
