        DESCRIPTION "Due to the incompetence or negligence of the learned magician's master, the character may spend 50 fewer experience points on his Arts and charms than normal. This Flaw may be taken multiple times, but may not reduce the available experience points to zero."
    }
    #tLNWU9XBVdAASY4sFVKjOnqO ^"Weak Amulets" DEF {
