            "2"
            "Double the daily production of an animal (eggs, milk, weight gain), or prevent daily production"
            "3"
            "Grant a +3 or –3 modifier to Stamina rolls to avoid contracting a disease, increase or decrease crop yield by one-half"
            "4"
            "Ensure the conception of a baby, strike a creature barren, ensure an easy childbirth, grant a +1 or –1 Living Condition Modifier to Aging (must last a year)"
            "5"
