            ^"Vis" STRING "6 pawns, a decayed apple"
            ^"Appearance" STRING "A fachan looks like a human, but has a single eye in the middle of its head, a single arm extending from its sternum, and a single leg. Fachans also have a black, feathered crest that runs from the top of their heads along their spines. The mouth of a fachan is inhumanly large."
