            ^"Page" INTEGER 38
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "4 points, Init equal to (Qik – 3) Corpus R: Voice, D: Sun, T: Group Bestows prowess in a given activity. For every Might point invested, ten men can be given a +1 to all rolls in a general situation (such as combat, or woodcraft); or 1 man can be given a +3 to a specific Total or Ability (such as Soak or Hunt). Might points spent on this power are only recovered when its effects are withdrawn. MuCo 20 (base 2, +2 Voice, +2 Sun, +2 Group): Lesser Power (20 levels, +1 Init)"
        REFERENCES {
