    #tPy1S7sUkw192xgWIbWJGWla ^"Guide" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Common Magic Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Page" INTEGER 39
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "3 points, Init equal to (Qik +1), Mentem R: Voice, D: Conc, T: Group Subtly influences a group of beings toward a specific course of action. Some creatures can use this power to direct the movement of a group, taking it to a desired location. Other creatures can guide humans toward rash actions, or brave actions, or wise actions. Each time this power is used, it can subtly influence the actions of a single person for a day. The storyguide should provide advice to the character in a similar way to the Common Sense Virtue, except that the advice serves the creature’s agenda, not that of the character. There is no compulsion to follow this advice. ReMe 30 (base 5, +2 Voice, +1 Conc, +2 Group): Greater Power (30 levels, +4 Init)"
        REFERENCES {
            "Common Sense" -> #tSmfpmVQdvf6p6lQevHDQz9B ^"Common Sense"
