        DESCRIPTION "This comprehensive use of glamour makes a place look, sound, smell, and feel like a suitable home for the role the fairie is playing. Not all faeries use this ability — it is usually restricted to faeries who travel within the Dominion, and cannot extend their glamour over their homes. Within the altered space, the sense of taste is also affected.

Costs 40 spell levels (MuIm Base 5, +1 Touch, +4 Until, +2 Room) an alternative that also costs 40 spell levels is (MuIm Base 5, +1 Touch, +2 Sun, +1 Constant, +3 Structure)"
    }
    #tTdUv8rsbim7SKSu5DtMTW2h ^"Kiss of Forgetfulness" DEF {
