        }
        DESCRIPTION "1 point, Init equal to (Qik – 2), Corpus R: Per, D: Sun, T: Ind The character transforms itself into the shape of a normal human being, allowing it to move through mundane society relatively unnoticed. MuFo 20 (base 10, +2 Sun): Personal Power (20 levels, –1 Might cost)"
        REFERENCES {
