            ^"Creature" STRING "The Stoneskinned" FIXED
            ^"Page" INTEGER 95
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "0 points, constant, Terram R: Per, D: Sun, T: Ind The character becomes more resistant to damage, gaining a +1 bonus to Soak and a –1 to Initiative for each 10 years of his age or magnitude of his Might Score. MuCo 15 (base 4, +2 Sun, +1 constant): Personal Power (15 levels, –2 Might cost, Variable Powers)"
        REFERENCES {
