            ^"Magical Qualities and Inferiorities" STRING "Greater Power (Crush), Greater Power (Slake Thirst), Improved Stamina; Improved Attack, Improved Damage x 2, Minor Virtue (Berserk), Minor Virtue (Great Stamina), Minor Virtue (Tough)"
            ^"Personality Trait" STRING "Cave +3*"
